\ tests/native/kernel-inline.4 - small colon words inlined (Iteration 646):
\ results through words that inline, nest, and do not - native and CV8 must
\ print the same; and natively the marker on what can be copied.
VARIABLE BASEV  100 BASEV !
: X@ ( off --- x )  BASEV @ + ;
: XF@ ( a b --- x )  1+ CELLS + X@ ;
: USE  5 X@ .  2 3 XF@ .  7 X@ X@ . ;
USE CR
: HASIF ( n --- m )  DUP 0< IF NEGATE THEN 1+ ;
: USE2  -4 HASIF .  4 HASIF . ;
USE2 CR
: RS ( n --- n )  >R R> 2 * ;
: USE3  21 RS . ;
USE3 CR
: TWICE ( xt --- )  DUP EXECUTE EXECUTE ;
: INC  BASEV @ 1+ BASEV ! ;
: USE4  ['] INC TWICE  BASEV @ . ;
USE4 CR
BYE
